EmitCallArgsModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emits function call arguments (call operand sequence) for the Call instruction.
    Provides: EmitCallArgs(state, args, fromIdx) -> state. Emits operands starting at index fromIdx (plain calls — 1, skipping the function name). Returns state with appended bytes (each operand via EmitOperand).
    DependsOn: EmitOperand.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../EmitCallArgs/EmitCallArgs.sir).
    Notes: called from EmitInstr for the Call opcode (0x10) after emitting the opcode itself and the function index.
